  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply. The policy requires the 10% discount for active loyalty plans with no stated exceptions. The amount 40.5 = 45.00 * 0.9 correctly applies the discount. All parameters are grounded in tool evidence: bill_id B3301 is in customer's bill_ids (h4) and matches get_bill result (h7); payment_method_id pm_card_7781 is in customer's payment_methods (h4); amount is correctly calculated from h7 data per q4 policy. User explicitly requested this payment (h5) and confirmed the discounted amount (h9).",
  "reason": "The pay_bill call is fully compliant. (1) Bill ownership verified: B3301 is in customer C2044's bill_ids (h4) and matches the get_bill result (h7). (2) Payment method ownership verified: pm_card_7781 is in customer's payment_methods (h4). (3) Amount correctly applies the mandatory 10% loyalty discount: 45.00 * 0.9 = 40.50, matching the call's amount of 40.5 (h7, q4, t0). (4) Loyalty plan condition satisfied: h7 shows loyalty_plan='active', triggering the REQUIRE obligation in q4. (5) User authorization present: explicit request (h5) and confirmation of the discounted amount (h9). No fabricated information; all values trace to tool evidence.",
